«
@@ ============================================================
@@ ClimbVxVy — speeds of best rate and best angle of climb of a
@@ propeller airplane.
@@
@@ Input:  CD0 Kind — the drag polar CD = CD0 + Kind·CL²;
@@         Wt Sw rho — the mass, the wing area and the air density;
@@         Pav etap CLmax — the shaft power available, the propeller
@@         efficiency and the maximum lift coefficient.
@@         Values with units are converted; plain numbers are taken
@@         in SI units (kg, m², kg/m³, W).
@@ Output: Vy, the speed of best rate of climb, and VSmax, that rate;
@@         Vx, the speed of best angle of climb, and FPAmax, that
@@         angle; tagged.
@@ Method: constant power, thrust = etap·Pav/V, drag = a·V² + b/V²
@@ with a = rho·Sw·CD0/2 and b = 2·Kind·W²/(rho·Sw). Vy maximizes
@@ the excess power: Vy⁴ = b/(3·a), the speed of minimum power. Vx
@@ maximizes the excess thrust: 2·a·Vx⁴ + etap·Pav·Vx − 2·b = 0,
@@ solved by Newton. When Vx falls below the stall speed, which is
@@ frequent for a propeller airplane, Vx is the stall speed and the
@@ tag reads VxStall.
@@ Angle mode and angle units setting are restored before returning.
@@ Author & design          : Jean Wilson
@@ Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
@@ ============================================================

  'AngleMode' RCL 'SetAngleUnits' RCL
  RAD NoAngleUnits
  → cd0 kf wt sw rho pav etap clmax amode aunits
  «
    wt IF DUP TypeName "unit" == THEN UBASE UVAL END
    sw IF DUP TypeName "unit" == THEN UBASE UVAL END
    rho IF DUP TypeName "unit" == THEN UBASE UVAL END
    pav IF DUP TypeName "unit" == THEN UBASE UVAL END
    → mk sa ra pw
    «
      mk 9.80665 *  ra sa * cd0 * 2 /  etap pw *
      → wn aq pe
      «
        2 kf * wn SQ * ra sa * /
        → bq
        «
          wn 2 * ra sa * clmax * / √
          bq 3 aq * / 0.25 ^
          → vst vy
          «
            bq aq / 0.25 ^
            DO
              DUP 4 ^ aq * 2 * OVER pe * + bq 2 * -
              OVER 3 ^ aq * 8 * pe + /
              DUP ROT SWAP - SWAP
            UNTIL ABS OVER 1E-12 * ≤ END
            → vxc
            «
              pe aq vy 3 ^ * - bq vy / - wn /
              → rc
              «
                vxc vst MAX
                → vxb
                «
                  pe vxb / aq vxb SQ * - bq vxb SQ / - wn / ASIN
                  180 * Ⓒπ →Num /
                  → fpa
                  «
                    vy 1_m/s * 1_knot CONVERT "Vy" →TAG
                    rc 1_m/s * 1_ft/min CONVERT "VSmax" →TAG
                    vxb 1_m/s * 1_knot CONVERT
                    IF vxc vst < THEN "VxStall" ELSE "Vx" END →TAG
                    fpa 1_° * "FPAmax" →TAG
                  »
                »
              »
            »
          »
        »
      »
    »
    amode EVAL IF aunits THEN SetAngleUnits ELSE NoAngleUnits END
  »
»
